    "sub_ename": "ACTUARIAL PRACTICE AND SOFTWARE (2)",
    "describe_ch": "學習操作精算軟體及精算與財務理論之應用，內容包括： 了解保險業資產負債管理之模型、操作精算軟體。所連結的課程： 現金流量模型、資產負債管理。\n",
    "describe_eh": "The main goals of this class is to learn how to operate actuarial software and to understand the application of actuarial and financial theories, including：\n1. Understanding the asset and liability management models.\n2. Operating actuarial software.\nThe linked courses：\n1. Cash flow models\n2. Asset and Liability Management\n",
